 "notes": "SIGNATURE. It opens like a curved sword and then never stops turning: hits two, three and four are all revolutions. It fights standing still in the middle of a group, which is the opposite of everything else in the class.\n\nLineage: reaver — Shorter, deeper-bellied raiding blades. They chop where a sickle sweeps.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 34.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
